# Built fixture: 130 MB, rebuilt from data/raw/ by scripts/build_fixture.py in
# seconds (the run records its own `build_seconds` in the manifest), pinned by the
# committed manifest.json (row counts + sha256). The 4 MB smoke fixture beside
# it IS committed so the test suite runs on a fresh clone. See CLAUDE.md.
data/fixtures/train.parquet
